:1,"wrong":0,"qtext":"<p>A time varying magnetic flux linking a coil is given by <img src=\"/media/8f61b3ba12c17825a96837da721353b3c822804c.png\" align=\"absmiddle\" loading=\"lazy\" /> If at time <em>t</em> = 4 sec, the emf induced is equal to 10 V. Then the value of k is ________. (upto two decimal places)</p></div>\n<div><span>NAT</span>","options":[],"nat":{"low":"-6.67","high":"-6.67"},"solution":"<p>-6.67 (-7.00 - -6.00)</p>\n<div> </div>\n<div><img src=\"/media/580a32c2ee5b2ee111a90e083c1fc7fd5d8dc2f0.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>","subject":"Technical"},{"qnum":8,"type":"MCQ","correct":"B","right":1,"wrong":0.33,"qtext":"<p>S-matrix for a two port transmission line is given by <img src=\"/media/cd8b46610f9d6c81b492f4af8130c51ccae7baa2.png\" align=\"absmiddle\" loading=\"lazy\" /> The reflection coefficient and the transmitted power through port 1 for the input power of 5 mW are respectively</p>","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"<div> 1, 0 mW</div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"B","text":"<div> 0, 5 mW</div>","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"C","text":"<div> 1, 3 mW</div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"D","text":"<div> 0, 3 mW</div>","isCorrect":false}],"nat":{"low":"","high":""},"solution":"<p>(b)</p>\n<div> </div>\n<div><img src=\"/media/160ce347cf24081917c753811135b67e78ce5b28.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>","subject":"Technical"},{"qnum":9,"type":"MCQ","correct":"C","right":2,"wrong":0.66,"qtext":"<p>The 50 Ω transmission line is terminated with a load impedance of 25 + <em>j</em>50 Ω. Then the centre of the R-circle on the Smith Chart for the given load impedance is located at</p>","options":[{"letter":"A","text":"<div> (0, 0.5)</div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"B","text":"<div> (0.04, 0)</div>","isCorrect":false},{"letter":"C","text":"<div> (0.33, 0)</div>","isCorrect":true},{"letter":"D","text":"<div> (0.5, 0)</div>","isCorrect":false}],"nat":{"low":"","high":""},"solution":"<p>(c)</p>\n<div> </div>\n<div><img src=\"/media/718e90d487046820e28c0f3cf2